    "id": "q03",
    "topic": "adjective-classification",
    "question": "Is きれい (kirei) an i-adjective or a na-adjective? How do you make it negative?",
    "answer": "きれい (kirei) is a **na-adjective**, not an i-adjective. Even though it ends in い, it follows na-adjective rules.  \nTo make it negative:  \n**きれいじゃないです** (kirei janai desu) — \"is not beautiful/clean.\"  \nExample:  \n- この部屋はきれいです。→ This room is clean.  \n- この部屋はきれいじゃないです。→ This room is not clean.  \n**Note**: Na-adjectives use **じゃない/ではありません** for negative forms, not **くないです** (which is for i-adjectives). This is a key exception!",
